# Build context for docker/web/Dockerfile and docker/worker/Dockerfile (context = repo root).
# Dependencies are installed inside the image from pnpm-lock.yaml; nothing local is copied in.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store

# Secrets never enter an image: runtime configuration comes from the platform's variables.
**/.env
**/.env.*

.git
.github
apps/ios
apps/web/e2e/screenshots
awesome-design-md
docs
deno.lock
